# Context harness maintenance

Read `.cursor/CONTEXT-HARNESS.md` for the full loop.

When the user corrects you, or you discover repo-specific behavior not in docs:

1. Add one bullet to `.cursor/context/LEARNINGS.md` (date + concise fact).
2. If it will recur, update `AGENTS.md` or the smallest matching `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` (under ~50 lines).
3. Prefer `@path/to/file` references over pasted code.
4. Do not duplicate README credit/deploy sections—link to `README.md` sections instead.

Skip harness edits for typos, one-line fixes, or generic coding advice.
